        "uuid": "35f3e374-67cc-43ca-9b18-ef8e102c6527",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The echogenicity of the mass being heterogeneous is not necessarily indicative of malignancy. Heterogeneous echogenicity can also be observed in benign lesions such as simple breast cysts",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 1
      },
      {
