        "uuid": "12b9cc4b-40ee-48e5-93a0-bfcfdf79660b",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The absence of irregular margins does not necessarily exclude malignancy, as benign lesions can also have irregular margins. The claim of irregular margins as a key feature associated with malignancy is not universally applicable",
